{"sourceUrl":"http://smee.whut.edu.cn/tzgg/yggg/202509/t20250916_1349192.shtml","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:13.512465+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://smee.whut.edu.cn/tzgg/yggg/202509/t20250916_1349192.shtml","html":"<div>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<div><p><br/></p><p><span>一、</span><span>申请条件</span></p><p><span>1.符合学校规定的基本条件。</span></p><p><span>2.本科期间学习成绩、思想品德优秀，无违纪处分。</span></p><p><span>3.接收获得所在学校推荐免试资格的应届本科毕业生报考。</span></p><p><span>4.2026年入学前获得本科毕业证书、学位证书。</span></p><p><span>5.</span><span>申请本科直博者，应具有较强的科研创新能力和培养潜力。</span></p><p><span>6</span><span>.招收推免生本科毕业专业限制：机械类、仪器类、工业工程类、电气类、电子信息类、自动化类、计算机类、材料类、能源动力类、轻工类、航空航天类、农业工程类等理工科相关专业。</span></p><p><span>二、</span><span>招生类别和招生人数</span></p><p><span>（一）本科直博生</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>序号</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>学习形式</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>拟招生人数</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>1</span></p></td><td><p><span>机械工程</span></p></td><td><p><span>080200</span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td><td><p><span>6</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>2</span></p></td><td><p><span>仪器科学与技术</span></p></td><td><p><span>080400</span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td><td><p><span>3</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><p><span>（二）硕士研究生</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>序号</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>学习形式</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>拟招生人数</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>1</span></p></td><td><p><span>机械工程</span></p></td><td><p><span>080200</span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制学硕</span></p></td><td><p><span>75</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>2</span></p></td><td><p><span>工业工程</span></p></td><td><p><span>0802Z1</span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制学硕</span></p></td><td><p><span>10</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>3</span></p></td><td><p><span>仪器科学与技术</span></p></td><td><p><span>080400</span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制学硕</span></p></td><td><p><span>8</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>4</span></p></td><td><p><span>机械工程</span></p></td><td><p><span>085501（01）</span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制专硕</span></p></td><td><p><span>50</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>5</span></p></td><td><p><span>智能制造技术</span></p></td><td><p><span>085509</span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制专硕</span></p></td><td><p><span>10</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>6</span></p></td><td><p><span>机器人工程</span></p></td><td><p><span>085510</span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制专硕</span></p></td><td><p><span>5</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><p><span>注：直博生</span><span>、</span><span>硕士生招生人数可根据实际情况做适当调整</span></p><p><span>三、</span><span>工作安排</span></p><p><strong><span><span>推免工作安排包括</span><span>“学</span></span></strong><strong><span>院</span></strong><strong><span><span>推免预报名系统</span><span>”和教育部“推免服务系统”报名确认两个阶段。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>1.</span></strong><strong><span>学</span></strong><strong><span>院</span></strong><strong><span>推免预报名系统</span></strong></p><p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）</span><span><span>预报名时间：</span><span>2025年</span></span><span>9月</span><span>16</span><span>日</span><span>14点</span><span>-9月</span><span>21</span><span>日</span><span>24点。</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）学院推免预报名系统</span><span>网址：</span></p><p><span>http://whlg.form.360eol.com/enroll/325phai3</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>3）报名要求：</span></span><span><span>申请人应在规定时间登录</span><span>“学</span></span><span>院</span><span><span>推免服务系统</span><span>”</span></span><span>报名</span><span>，</span><span>并</span><span>将推免资格证明（</span><span>或</span><span>处于推免公示期</span><span>的</span><span>证明</span><span>材料</span><span><span>）制成一个</span><span>PDF文件（10M以内），以“姓名+推免生+拟报考专业+硕士/博士”命名，上传系统。</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）</span><span>学院根据报名情况分批在学院官网公布预报名名单。</span></p><p><span><span>学院官网：</span><span>http://smee.whut.edu.cn/tzgg/yggg/</span></span></p><p><strong><span>2</span></strong><strong><span>.</span></strong><strong><span>教育部推免服务系统报名</span></strong></p><p><span>所有报考</span><span>我院</span><span>的申请人（含已参加</span><span>我院</span><span>2026年研究生推免预报名的申请人）</span><span>必须</span><span><span>登录教育部</span><span>“推免服务系统”（网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/）进行网上注册、专业志愿填报，</span></span><span>并</span><span>按要求提交相关材料。</span></p><p><span><span>教育部</span><span>“推免服务系统”预计9月22日开通，</span></span><span>具体以系统</span><span>实际开通时间为准。</span></p><p><strong><span>3.复试</span></strong></p><p><span>（1）</span><span>资格审核</span></p><p><span><span>时间：</span><span>2025年9月24日（周三）9:00-13:00。</span></span></p><p><span>地点：机电工程学院一楼大厅。</span></p><p><span>审核材料：身份证、学生证，教育部系统发送的复试短信。</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）</span><span>面试</span></p><p><span><span>时间：</span><span>2025年9月24日（周三）14:00开始。</span></span></p><p><span>地点：资格审查当日公布，具体考场见现场公告。</span></p><p><span>面试主要考核考生的思想政治素质、专业基础知识、创新思维能力、外语听说能力、学术视野、培养潜力、综合运用知识的能力和心理品质等方面的内容。</span><span>考核时间</span><span>不超过</span><span>10分钟</span><span>，</span><span><span>满分</span><span>100分，</span></span><span><span>成绩低于</span><span>60分的考生，</span></span><span>将不予录取</span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>4</span></strong><strong><span>.</span></strong><strong><span>拟</span></strong><strong><span>录取</span></strong></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1）学院将按</span></span><span>面试</span><span>成绩由高到低依次录取，</span><span>额满为止，</span><span>确定拟录取名单</span><span>，</span><span>并通过</span><span><span>教育部</span><span>“推免服务系统”</span></span><span>发送拟录取通知。</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2）考生</span></span><span>须在规定时间内通过</span><span>“推免服务系统”</span><span>完成</span><span>待录取</span><span>确认，</span><span>逾期未确认的考生，视为放弃待录取资格，我院可撤销该生录取通知。</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>3）完成</span></span><span>待录取</span><span>确认</span><span>的考生，视为同意将我校作为其唯一录取学校，一旦操作不可更改。我院汇总同意待录取的考生名单，并</span><span>按要求</span><span>进行网上公示。</span></p><p><span>四、</span><span>注意事项</span></p><p><span>1.申请人必须保证全部申请材料的真实性和准确性，一经发现申请人提交的材料内容不真实或不准确，</span><span>学院</span><span>将取消拟录取资格。</span></p><p><span>2.所有推免生(含硕士生、直博生)必须通过教育部推免服务系统完成所有的工作程序。</span></p><p><span>五、</span><span>联系方式</span></p><p><span>联系人：王老师</span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span><span>027-87218976</span></span></p><p><span><span>地址：湖北省武汉市洪山区珞狮路</span><span>122号武汉理工大学机电工程学院研工办</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮编：</span><span>430070</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>武汉理工大学机电工程学院</span></p><p><span>2025年9月1</span><span>6</span><span>日</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>","textSha256":"f8e3201279fb1d0970526360f363c93252b4f513b1ec303ea63a7a6c2a0f2cd8","textLength":1533,"sourceSha256":"051f254df6b3d4d9aec8868c2d252e77875ccec70f49376235bef9536f68fad5","selector":"article-like:article-box","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2302760080418f1843e5","title":"2025年武汉理工大学机电工程学院2026年推荐免试攻读硕士学位和直接攻读博士学位研究生招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:13.512465+00:00"}
